DO IT SERVICES — Complete Project Understanding
Business Model Understanding

DO IT SERVICES is a cash collection/distribution company.

Workflow:
Multiple retailers/stores operate under DO IT SERVICES.
Some retailers do self-collection and deposit money themselves.
Other retailers rely on DO IT staff for collection and bank deposit.

Field staff:

visit retailer/store locations
collect cash
record denominations
track KM/attendance
generate collection records
deposit cash to bank
report activity to owner/admin

Currently this workflow is fragmented across:

cash calculator apps
PDFs
manual reports
Khatabook entries
manual reconciliation

Goal:

unify entire workflow into one platform.

Main Problem Being Solved

Current system requires:

Staff collects money
Staff generates PDF manually
Another person updates Khatabook manually
Reports tracked manually
No centralized live dashboard
No unified ledger/reporting

New platform should:

centralize operations
reduce manual work
track collections live
generate reports automatically
maintain retailer ledgers
monitor staff activity
simplify reconciliation
Final Platform Type
Web-Based PWA (Progressive Web App)

NOT:

native Android initially
desktop software

Reason:

owner mostly uses phone
staff use phones
faster development
easier deployment
offline support possible
no Play Store dependency
